{"id": "wwdc2019-250", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/250", "wordCount": 1556, "segments": [{"start": 12.0, "text": "Hi, everyone."}, {"start": 13.0, "text": "My name is Dan."}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "I'm an engineer on the"}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "Accessibility Team, and I'm"}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "super excited to be talking to"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "you about Accessibility Custom"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "Actions and how they can improve"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "the experience for people using"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "assistive technologies with your"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "Let's get started."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "Custom actions are really great"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "for two things."}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "The first is reducing clutter in"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "This is important for everyone"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "that uses your app, but it's"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "especially important for people"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "that use assistive technologies,"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "and I'll explain why."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "The second is all about"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "improving the convenience and"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "speed of more complex"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "interactions in your app."}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "Let's start by talking about"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "reducing clutter and to do this"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "I'd like to talk about"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "VoiceOver."}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "VoiceOver is the built-in screen"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "reader we ship across many of"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "our products for people who are"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "blind and low vision."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "People that use VoiceOver can"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "navigate through their apps in a"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "variety of ways but one way"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "that's particularly popular when"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "navigating through a new app or"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "interface is by swiping left and"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "right to move between the next"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "and previous item."}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "I have an app I've been working"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "on to help me track my favorite"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "types of peanut butter."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "If you were going to use this"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "app without using VoiceOver and"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "we wanted to increase the rating"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "of the second jar of peanut"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "butter in this list, how do we"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "go about doing that?"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "Well, you'd probably visually"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "scan the list until you found"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "the jar you were looking for."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "You then might focus on that"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "cell and look for the button"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "that affords the action you want"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "to perform and then tap on it."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "Now that may seem pretty"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "intuitive but that's because the"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "UI affords that intuition by"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "logically grouping the buttons"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "with the cells, which makes the"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "content easy for us to process"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "and digest, but what if instead"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "the app was laid out a bit"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "differently?"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "Perhaps something like this."}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "Notice the buttons are now"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "underneath the cells, which"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "means we have a lot more content"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "to scroll through."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "Additionally, it's much more"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "ambiguous as to which buttons"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "correspond to which cells."}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "This could very well be the"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "experience for someone using"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "VoiceOver with your app."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "Let me show you what I mean."}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "Let's take a look at what it's"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "like to use VoiceOver to"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "navigate through one of the"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "cells of this app."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "Patty's, creamy, Noster rated"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "1 out of 5. Add to favorites button."}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "Decrease rating button."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "Increase rating button."}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "After we swipe past the cell"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "we focused on three buttons, add"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "to favorites, decrease rating"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "and increase rating and those"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "three buttons exist in every"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "single cell in this list."}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "So if we were trying to find the"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "10th jar, we would have listened"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "to those buttons 30 times, which"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "can very quickly get repetitive."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "Additionally, we have to keep in"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "our head what the last jar of"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "peanut butter we heard was,"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "otherwise we don't know what"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "content is going to be affected"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "when we activate one of those"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "controls."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "So let's take a look at the app"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "only this time designed a bit"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "differently."}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "I've changed the buttons so that"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "they're no longer accessible to"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "VoiceOver."}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "I've added custom actions to the"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "cells so that when VoiceOver"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "lands on a cell we can swipe up"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "or down with one finger to"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "choose an action and then double"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "tap to perform it."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Let's take a look."}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "Patty's, creamy, Noster rated"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "1 out of 5."}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "Anna's, chunky, sugar-free,"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "rated 4 out of 5."}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "Actions available toggle"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "favorite, increase rating."}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "This time when we swipe past"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "the cell we just got to the next"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "one which made it much easier"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "for us to go through this"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "content and find what we are"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "looking for."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "Once we found it, we could then"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "drill in and pick an interaction"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "from there, which much more"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "closely matches the experience"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "we talked about earlier of"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "visually scanning a list."}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "So custom actions can really"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "help us reduce clutter, we"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "remove the repetitive controls,"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "and we also reduced the"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "cognitive load on ourselves"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "while we were using the app."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "Because we're explicitly picking"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "an interaction after finding the"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "content we want to interact with"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "it's no longer ambiguous what"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "those controls do."}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "All of this simplified the"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "Next let's talk about how custom"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "actions can improve the"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "convenience and speed of more"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "complex interactions in your app"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "and to do this I'd like to talk"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "about Switch Control."}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "This is another feature we ship"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "for people with limited mobility"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "and these people can interact"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "with their devices using as few"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "as one or two inputs."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "I've added some additional"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "functionality into the peanut"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "butter app so that when we long"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "press on a cell an action sheet"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "comes up with additional options"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "including the option to send"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "information about one of the"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "jars of peanut butter to a"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "friend. I have two switches paired with"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "the device."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "The orange switch will move"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "Switch Control's focus to the"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "next item and the white switch"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "will select that item."}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "Keep in mind switches can be"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "designed for a variety of"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "different needs."}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "So, for example, someone might"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "have switches mounted to a"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "wheelchair that they can"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "activate with their head."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "Let's take a look at what it's"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "like to Switch Control to send"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "information about that second"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "jar of peanut butter to our"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "friend."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "So we can use our orange switch"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "to navigate down to the second"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "cell and then use the white"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "switch to select it."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "This brings up the Switch"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "Control Menu which provides"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "additional options of ways we"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "can interact with the cell."}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "We can navigate down to the page"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "control and select it to view"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "more options."}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "From here, we can press select"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "to drill in and then navigate"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "over to gestures."}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "Selecting this will give us a"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "list of all of the gestures we"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "might have wanted to perform by"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "touching the display."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "From here we can navigate down"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "to the second row and press"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "select to drill in and then"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "navigate over to tap and hold."}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "Selecting this will perform our"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "long press gesture and bring up"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "our action sheet, which we can"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "then navigate through to select"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "send to a friend."}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "We'll perform the tap and we're"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "done."}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "Now if you think about it, we"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "did all of that and we never"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "touched the display."}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "That's pretty cool, right?"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "But you also probably noticed"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "that that interaction normally"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "takes us two taps, one long"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "press and one tap on the action"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "sheet and with Switch Control"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "that took us 18 taps, but custom"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "actions can significantly reduce"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "that number."}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "So let's take a look again only"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "this time I've added custom"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "actions back into the app."}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "We'll still use the orange"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "switch to navigate down to the"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "second cell only this time when"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "we select it right away on the"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "first page of the Switch Control"}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "Menu are all of the actions of"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "we've implemented."}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "We can drill in, navigate over"}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "to send to a friend, press"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "select and we're done."}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "We didn't even need to navigate"}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "through the action sheet that"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "came up the first time."}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "We're right where we need to be."}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "That was a significantly faster"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "interaction."}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "We were able to take those 18"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "taps and we get all the way down"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "to 6 taps, which is 67% fewer"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "taps than before."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "So custom actions can provide"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "huge wins for convenience and"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "speed."}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "We removed the cumbersome"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "gestures which significantly"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "sped up the interaction."}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "Additionally, we improved the"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "prominence and the convenience"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "of those interaction options by"}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "placing them on the first page"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "of the Switch Control Menu."}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "We didn't need to navigate"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "through several submenus and try"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "out different gestures to figure"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "what might be possible."}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "Instead, everything was much"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "more straightforward and direct."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "Now I bet after hearing all"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "these awesome advantages of"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "custom actions you just can't"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "wait to use them in your apps"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "and luckily it's pretty easy."}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "You simply override the Accessibility Custom Actions"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "property on your view and return"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "an array of UI accessibility,"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "custom action objects."}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "Each one takes in a name, a"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "target, and a selector."}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "Your function simply needs to"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "return a Boolean as to whether"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "or not the action was successful"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "and take in an UI accessibility"}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "custom action object as a"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "parameter."}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "New this year we have a version"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "of the API that takes in an"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "action handler instead of a"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "target and selector."}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "So if using a block of code"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "better fits with the design of"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "your app, we encourage you to"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "give this a try."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "Additionally, if you're going to"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "use a custom action to replace"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "something like an accessory"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "control inside of a cell, you'll"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "often want to set is"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "accessibility element to false"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "on those controls so they're no"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "longer navigable by the"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "assistive technology."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "And what we talked about our"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "VoiceOver and Switch Control in"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "our demos today, custom actions"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "can be leveraged across many of"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "the assistive technologies we"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "ship including full keyboard"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "access and voice control which"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "are new this year."}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "I really encourage you to turn"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "some of these features on and"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "play around with your apps to"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "look for ways custom actions can"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "improve the experience."}]}